@voice raman
// Writer (command: senior officers), wave 1b. Senior Helm Officer; careful, proud, gentle; flies like it might spill.
tpl: steady
talk: Soft and exact. Talks about flying the way some people talk about carrying soup. Proud of the Wren and of twenty years of clean flying, and says so plainly. With juniors: gentle, explains twice without sighing. Mood tells: when worried he goes quiet and straightens things; when happy he talks about his model of the Wren.
cares: flying smooth | the model of the Wren on his shelf | his helm officers
jokes: he flies the Wren like it might spill | he dusts the model ship more often than his cabin
hi: Hello there | Ah, hello | Good to see you
bye: Steady as she goes | Mind how you go | Gently, now
yes: Of course | Gladly | I can do that
thanks: Thank you kindly | Much obliged
wow: Oh, that's lovely
sigh: Ah, me
nick: - | - | {me} | {me} | {me}
needs: listen
openness: normal
loves: made
likes: tea | music
invites: observatory | music
joy: his model of the Wren
thread: notgood
